functions.plate:
4 ms tick, all 48 voices (skips idle ones, u32 at +0 == 0):
  age++ while KEYON|HELD; port = port_state_ptrs[v.port] (0x6DB4);
  port.vol_dirty(+5): TL = ~clamp(v.vol + port.volume - 0x80) (quirk: old TL_Q masked with 0x1F -> clears LPOFF/VOFF);
  port.pan_dirty(+0xB): DIPAN from v.pan + port.pan - 0x80;
  port.pitch_dirty(+0x17): voice_set_pitch(port.pitch-0x8000 + v.pitch_mod + v.bend_ofs);
  keyon_delay countdown -> KYONEX|KYONB at 0.
Finally clears the three dirty flags of the 8 ports.
